%% MVVM Data Flow - Cach du lieu di chuyen giua cac tang
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Nguoi dung
    participant V as View (Activity/Fragment)
    participant VM as ViewModel
    participant R as Repository
    participant FS as Firebase / API
    participant LD as LiveData

    U->>V: Tuong tac (click, type,...)
    V->>VM: Goi method (loadCart, login,...)
    VM->>R: Goi tac vu I/O
    R->>FS: Firestore query / OkHttp call
    FS-->>R: Snapshot / Response
    R-->>VM: Callback (data hoac error)
    VM->>LD: postValue / setValue
    LD-->>V: observe -> cap nhat UI
    V-->>U: Hien thi ket qua

    Note over VM,LD: ViewModel song theo lifecycle Activity/Fragment<br/>LiveData tu dong huy listener khi View destroy
